{"title":"2025 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Azizi sold chocolate bars from Monday to Friday over three weeks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>During the second week, he sold the following numbers of chocolate bars:\n</p><p>(Add a table: Monday = 7, Tuesday = 15, Wednesday = x, Thursday = 23, Friday = x)\n</p><p>He sold a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b03f8ead3b3da0bd2cbc1a41d8f01630e638f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> chocolate bars during the second week. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply add all of the chocolate bars together and set it equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b03f8ead3b3da0bd2cbc1a41d8f01630e638f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the number given in the problem.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a7542bc128cce7a248906cd0efe3ebccb59abe2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 + 15 + x + 23 + x = 73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"199\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f8a2e9fd711ea5c0554a78261952212d43f171b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 45 = 73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c2411cd2768c6b82b748b632f4a612b0cf435cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 73 - 45 = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"147\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/2/b52989be37e088110b46447b41da51aa197785a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{28}{2} = \\boxed{14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018031914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 35/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 143/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1282/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.951      1 2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.951      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35022:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018031914 and revision id 271997. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}